 ("Locomotion and Movement", "The functional contractile unit of a skeletal muscle fibre is the ____.", ["sarcomere"], "The part between two Z lines."),
 ("Neural Control and Coordination", "The gap between two neurons where impulses pass is called a ____.", ["synapse"], "It can be electrical or chemical."),
 ("Chemical Coordination and Integration", "Diabetes insipidus is caused by deficiency of the hormone ____.", ["ADH", "vasopressin", "antidiuretic hormone"], "Without ADH, large amounts of dilute urine are lost."),
 ("Human Reproduction", "The hormone detected in pregnancy tests is ____.", ["hCG", "human chorionic gonadotropin"], "Secreted by the placenta."),
 ("Reproductive Health", "Amniocentesis tests for genetic disorders by examining cells in the ____ fluid.", ["amniotic"], "Its misuse for sex determination is banned in India."),
 ("Principles of Inheritance and Variation", "The number of chromosomes in a person with Turner's syndrome is ____.", ["45"], "Karyotype 45, X0."),
