 ("Human Health and Disease", "The causal organism of amoebiasis is Entamoeba ____.", ["histolytica"], "Spread by houseflies contaminating food and water."),
 ("Microbes in Human Welfare", "The yeast used in making bread and brewing is Saccharomyces ____.", ["cerevisiae"], "It ferments sugars to CO₂ and ethanol."),
