 ("Ecosystem", "The rate of biomass production per unit area over a time period is called ____.", ["productivity"], "Expressed as g m⁻² yr⁻¹ or kcal m⁻² yr⁻¹."),
 ("Biodiversity and Conservation", "Regions with very high species richness and endemism under threat are called biodiversity ____.", ["hotspots", "hotspot"], "Three hotspots — Western Ghats and Sri Lanka, Indo-Burma and Himalaya — cover India's richest regions (NCERT)."),
